# KSI-RPL-ABO: Azure Recovery Services Vault - Backup Protection
# Validates RSV soft delete, geo-redundant storage, and cross-region restore

META
    esp_id `ksi-rpl-abo-az-rsv-backup-protection-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `azure`
    criticality `high`

    title `KSI-RPL-ABO: Azure RSV - backup protection and geo-redundancy`
    description `Validates that the Recovery Services vault has soft delete enabled with adequate retention, geo-redundant storage for cross-region durability, and cross-region restore capability for disaster recovery`
    author `security-team`
    tags `azure,rsv,backup,geo-redundant,soft-delete,disaster-recovery`

    control_mapping `KSI:KSI-RPL-ABO,KSI:KSI-RPL-ARP,NIST:CP-9,NIST:CP-10`
    control_objective `KSI-RPL-ABO`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `cloud-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `7`
    recommendation `Configure RSV with geo-redundant storage, enable soft delete with at least 14 day retention, and enable cross-region restore for disaster recovery capability`

    impl_KSI_RPL_ABO `Backup alignment with recovery objectives is validated by confirming the Recovery Services vault uses geo-redundant storage (storage_redundancy=GeoRedundant) for cross-region data durability, has cross-region restore enabled for disaster recovery in a paired region, soft delete is active (soft_delete_state=Enabled) with at least 14 days retention to prevent accidental or malicious deletion of backup data, and enhanced security state is enabled for additional protection against ransomware attacks on backup infrastructure.`

    impl_KSI_RPL_ARP `Recovery plan alignment is validated by confirming geo-redundant storage and cross-region restore are enabled, ensuring backup data survives a complete regional outage and can be restored in the paired Azure region.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT rsv_demo
        name `rsv-example-prod`
        resource_group `rg-example-eastus`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE st_backup_protected
        found boolean = true
        provisioning_state string = `Succeeded`
        storage_redundancy string = `GeoRedundant`
        cross_region_restore string = `Enabled`
        soft_delete_state string = `Enabled`
        soft_delete_retention_days int >= 14
        enhanced_security_state string = `Enabled`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN az_recovery_services_vault
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF st_backup_protected
            OBJECT_REF rsv_demo
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
